# --- generated evidence, never packaged --------------------------------
# Evidence directory: kept out of Git except the mutation reports (small text a
# reviewer can check) and the explainer video, which IS a submission deliverable
# and must travel with the repository rather than only sitting in a sandbox.
artifacts/*
